  "notes": [
    "Targets: FundManagementLogic, linked into the controller, prices collateral with the market's same-block unit price, and the LendingMarket computes it; both are defect-bearing. The controller's last upgrade (only LiquidationLogic changed) is the latest route change and sets the age.",
    "Campaign: eight further Ethereum drains by the anchor attacker, a front-running bot (0xc0ffeebabe) and two other actors, three Arbitrum drains by the anchor attacker, and three Filecoin drains (Blockscout data; repo tools have no Filecoin RPC). Deposits made inside each drain are netted.",
    "Filecoin: the attacker's 26.69 USDFC and 40 WFIL deposits in its separate prepare transactions were withdrawn in the drains and are subtracted (rule 14); USDFC at par (DefiLlama showed 1.118 during the drain), WFIL and iFIL at DefiLlama prices."
